          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# Risk Assessment Analytics\n\nMonitor risk assessment decisions, approval policy usage, and code change patterns.\n\n**Key Metrics:** Risk level distribution, approval policy decisions, protected file modifications, code complexity",
